      destruct PO as (y0 & y1 & y2 & ya0 & ya1 & ya2 & ya3 & ya4 & ya5 & ya6 & ya7 & y3 & y4 & y5 & y6 & m1 & mo1 & hc1 & r & LB1 & o & md1 & pk1
